* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

# Packet Tracer containers are ciphertext. `text=auto` guesses from content, and
# a sealed container that happens to hold a CR and no NUL is guessed wrong —
# `eol=lf` would then rewrite that byte on checkout and the authentication tag
# would no longer verify. Never let a heuristic touch these.
*.pkt binary
*.pka binary
